      "title_ko": "Claude Code가 Codex CLI에 코딩 작업을 위임하는 MCP 서버 0.6.1",
      "update_of": null,
      "verification_summary": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "evidence_quote": "An MCP server that lets **Claude Code delegate coding tasks to OpenAI's Codex CLI** running on the same machine, with the model and reasoning depth chosen per task.",
            "evidence_url": "https://github.com/parisbs/codex-subagent-mcp",
            "role": "what",
            "sentence_index": 0,
            "text": "Claude Code가 같은 머신의 Codex CLI에 코딩 작업을 위임하는 MCP 서버가 나왔다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "You pick the model and the reasoning effort per task, from the catalog your Codex CLI reports live. - Read-only by default, with a sandbox ceiling no tool call can exceed.",
            "evidence_url": "https://github.com/parisbs/codex-subagent-mcp",
            "role": "what",
            "sentence_index": 1,
            "text": "모델과 reasoning effort를 작업별로 고르고, 기본은 읽기 전용으로 동작한다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "Delegating the investigation returns the answer instead of the forty files. **One model has one set of blind spots.** A second opinion is worth most when it comes from a different model family",
            "evidence_url": "https://github.com/parisbs/codex-subagent-mcp",
            "role": "why",
            "sentence_index": 0,
            "text": "긴 탐색이나 리뷰를 컨텍스트를 덜 쓰며 외부 에이전트에 맡길 수 있다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "The value here is not a second run — it is a different set of blind spots. > Ask Codex to review `src/server.ts` for correctness problems, focusing on error paths.",
            "evidence_url": "https://github.com/parisbs/codex-subagent-mcp",
            "role": "why",
            "sentence_index": 1,
            "text": "하나의 모델이 아닌 다른 모델 패밀리로 재검토를 시켜 blind spot을 줄일 수 있다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "```bash claude mcp add codex-subagent -- npx -y codex-subagent-mcp ```",
            "evidence_url": "https://github.com/parisbs/codex-subagent-mcp",
            "role": "how",
            "sentence_index": 0,
            "text": "설치 예시는 `claude mcp add codex-subagent -- npx -y codex-subagent-mcp`다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "Requires **Node.js 22+** and the **[Codex CLI](https://developers.openai.com/codex/cli)** installed, on `PATH`, and signed in.",
            "evidence_url": "https://github.com/parisbs/codex-subagent-mcp",
            "role": "how",
            "sentence_index": 1,
            "text": "Node.js 22+와 Codex CLI 설치, PATH 등록, 로그인 상태가 필요하다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "Ask Claude to run `codex_doctor` if anything is missing.",
            "evidence_url": "https://github.com/parisbs/codex-subagent-mcp",
            "role": "how",
            "sentence_index": 2,
            "text": "문제가 있으면 `codex_doctor`를 실행하라고 안내한다."
          }
        ],
