        {
          "org": "arXiv",
          "source_class": "research",
          "source_id": "arxiv-cs-cl",
          "title": "RECAP: Training Long-horizon LLM Agents with Context Compaction",
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.31258"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "context-compaction",
        "long-horizon-agents",
        "reinforcement-learning",
        "self-distillation",
        "swe-bench"
      ],
      "title_ko": "RECAP: 긴 호흡 에이전트를 위한 컨텍스트 압축 학습",
      "update_of": null,
      "verification_summary": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "evidence_quote": "We introduce RECAP, a reinforcement learning (RL) framework based on the principle that a summary should preserve the behavior induced by the original interaction history.",
            "evidence_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.31258",
            "role": "what",
            "sentence_index": 0,
            "text": "RECAP는 긴 작업용 LLM 에이전트의 컨텍스트 압축을 함께 학습하는 RL 프레임워크를 제안한다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "We formalize this principle with a behavior distortion objective that measures the divergence between the agent's subsequent behavior under compressed and original contexts.",
            "evidence_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.31258",
            "role": "what",
            "sentence_index": 1,
            "text": "요약이 원래 대화의 행동을 얼마나 보존하는지에 따라 학습 신호를 주는 방식이다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "Context compaction enables large language model agents to tackle long-horizon tasks within limited context budgets by replacing interaction histories with compressed summaries.",
            "evidence_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.31258",
            "role": "why",
            "sentence_index": 0,
            "text": "긴 작업에서 요약 품질이 성능을 좌우하는 에이전트에 바로 참고할 수 있다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "leading to an absolute improvement of 4.6% and 4.3% on BrowseComp-plus and SWE-bench Verified, respectively.",
            "evidence_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.31258",
            "role": "why",
            "sentence_index": 1,
            "text": "SWE-bench Verified와 BrowseComp-plus에서 기존 보상만 쓰는 RL보다 성능이 올랐다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "Experiments on Qwen3.5-4B show that RECAP consistently outperforms the task-reward-only RL baselines on both environments",
            "evidence_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.31258",
            "role": "how",
            "sentence_index": 0,
            "text": "Qwen3.5-4B로 실험했고, 요약 생성과 후속 행동을 함께 감독한다."
          },
          {
            "evidence_quote": "the gradient of the distortion objective decomposes into two complementary learning signals: distortion-based reward for summary generation and self-distillation for subsequent actions.",
            "evidence_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.31258",
            "role": "how",
            "sentence_index": 1,
            "text": "행동 왜곡 목적과 self-distillation 신호를 결합해 학습한다."
          }
        ],
        "level": "verified",
        "uncertainty": null
      },
      "what": [
        "RECAP는 긴 작업용 LLM 에이전트의 컨텍스트 압축을 함께 학습하는 RL 프레임워크를 제안한다.",
